        "title": "Description and rationale",
        "body": "A link is an ordinary hyperlink: something here points at an address, on the web or anywhere else an address can name. It claims nothing about the thing it points at, and asks nothing of it.\n\nA link is drawn in the workspace when both of its ends are there, however that comes about: the thing that holds the link, and whatever its address names.",
